 r←∆MakeDependencyNamespace nameValues;names;values;name;value
⍝ Returns a dependency namespace as `ParseDependencySetting` expects it, e.g. `config.CIDER.dependencies`.
⍝ `nameValues` is a flat list of names and values: 'tatin' 'pkgs' 'tatinTarget' 'Foo'. Empty gives an empty namespace.
 r←⎕NS''
 names←((≢nameValues)⍴1 0)/nameValues
 values←((≢nameValues)⍴0 1)/nameValues
 :For name value :InEach names values
     ⍎'r.',name,'←value'
 :EndFor
⍝Done
